Shared utility for bot actions (used by both list and detail ViewModels)

This provides a centralized place for pause/resume/stop actions that can be
called from any context (Running Bots List, Bot Detail, etc.)

## Usage (Swift)
```swift
let executor = BotActionExecutor()

if executor.stopNeedsConfirmation(bot: bot) {
// Navigate to StopBotInteractor flow
} else {
try await executor.stopDirect(algoId: bot.algoId, instId: bot.instId, botType: bot.botType)
}

// Pause/Resume (Grid bots only)
let result = try await executor.pause(algoId: bot.algoId)
try await executor.resume(algoId: bot.algoId, topUpAmt: nil)
```
